title: Targets
---

Either a list of targets, or a map of targets to paths.

## Variants

### `List`

A list of targets.

| Attribute | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Type | `string[]` |

### `Map`

A map of targets.

| Attribute | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Type | `Record<string, string>` |
